//Redefine Constants

Define xtpTreeViewHideLines       for OLExtpTreeViewHideLines       //0
Define xtpTreeViewShowLines       for OLExtpTreeViewShowLines       //1
Define xtpTreeViewShowLinesAtRoot for OLExtpTreeViewShowLinesAtRoot //2

Define xtpTreeViewLabelAutomatic for OLExtpTreeViewLabelAutomatic //0
Define xtpTreeViewLabelManual    for OLExtpTreeViewLabelManual    //1

Define xtpTreeViewFirst for OLExtpTreeViewFirst     //0
Define xtpTreeViewLast  for OLExtpTreeViewLast      //1
Define xtpTreeViewNext  for OLExtpTreeViewNext      //2
Define xtpTreeViewPrev  for OLExtpTreeViewPrevious  //3
Define xtpTreeViewChild for OLExtpTreeViewChild     //4

Define xtpOLEDropNone   for OLExtpOLEDropNone   //0
Define xtpOLEDropManual for OLExtpOLEDropManual //1

Enum_List
