    End_Function

    //-------------------------------------------------------------------------

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False  }
    Procedure Set piLevel Integer iLevel
        Integer iIndex
        tdTreeviewNodeTag[] tNodeTags

        Get ptNodeTags to tNodeTags
        Get ComIndex   to iIndex
        Move iLevel    to tNodeTags[iIndex].iLevel
        Set ptNodeTags to tNodeTags
    End_Procedure

